// Plan H slice 4 — exercise the abilities.telegraph_* namespace
// methods end-to-end. The cast block lowers to:
//   * EffectOp::CastBegin in `effects` (kind=46, dispatched as
//     EffectKindId::EffectCastBeginApplied = 77)
//   * `pending_program` populated from the `effect { ... }` body (a
//     heal 0 placeholder so pending_program isn't empty — matching
//     the firebolt_probe / palace_coup MVP convention)
//   * `telegraph_kind = TelegraphKind::Circle (= 1)`
//   * `telegraph_params[0] = 4.0` (radius in world units)
//
// Sole-ability convention: the alphabetical sort of the ability dir
// places this at AbilityId 1 (NonZero ids start at 1; the empty-
// registry sentinel is 0). The .sim's MarkCasterBusy stamps
// `busy_with_ability_id = 1` so the fold body's
// `abilities.telegraph_*(busy_with_ability_id)` reads resolve to
// THIS ability's telegraph metadata.

ability Probe {
    target: self
    cooldown: 10s
    hint: utility

    cast { duration: 100t telegraph: circle(self.pos, radius: 4.0) }
    effect { heal 0 }
}
